Hey, when did you buy a ring?

565
00:49:30,840 --> 00:49:32,880
You keep making me play an F chord.

566
00:49:35,920 --> 00:49:37,040
Can I move forward?

567
00:49:37,800 --> 00:49:38,920
What's that supposed to mean?

568
00:49:46,880 --> 00:49:48,600
