Yeah.

573
00:50:23,920 --> 00:50:24,880
Thank you.

574
00:50:27,920 --> 00:50:31,360
I'm sorry I kept you waiting so long.

575
00:50:31,960 --> 00:50:33,440
I thought I'd never hear

576
00:50:35,120 --> 00:50:37,000
you say those words in this lifetime.

577
00:51:29,000 --> 00:51:31,160
Now you're being cute.

578
00:51:38,080 --> 00:51:41,720
